        note: "\u0110\u1EB7t ch\u1ED7 th\xE0nh c\xF4ng. Kh\xE1ch s\u1EBD thanh to\xE1n khi g\u1EB7p nh\xE2n vi\xEAn. Danh t\xEDnh b\u1ECB kho\xE1 cho \u0111\u1EBFn khi nh\xE2n vi\xEAn m\u1EDF kho\xE1 th\u1EE7 c\xF4ng.",
        warning: "\u26A0 PAY_ON_ARRIVAL c\xF3 r\u1EE7i ro ghosting. G\u1ECDi POST /api/bookings/order/:orderId/manual-unlock khi th\u1EF1c s\u1EF1 g\u1EB7p kh\xE1ch.",
        manual_unlock_url: `/api/bookings/order/${orderId}/manual-unlock`
